{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "description": "otel+grafana 一本化後の主可視化。Tier 1（PR 単位 gauge agent_pr_* ＋ raw events Loki）に加え、Tier 2（既存 gauge の last_over_time 集約で出すヘッドライン stat / 週別 merged PR trend）を表示。Tier 2 は pr_metrics（is_merged=1 限定）由来のため merged-PR 寄与分のみで、全 session 総量ではない（各パネル description 参照）。session-grain（Tier 3）は issues/0053、並列度（Tier 4）は issues/0054 で別管理。",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "状態評価 — 開発活動の推移（Tier 2: merged-PR gauge 集約）",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "title": "merged PRs",
      "description": "期間内に merge された PR 数。`agent_pr_*` gauge は `pr_metrics`（is_merged=1 限定）を集約した sparse 系列なので、`last_over_time([$__range])` で range 内の最終値を拾い、`group by (pr_url)` で重複ラベル（model 違い等）を畳んで distinct PR を数える。merged 限定の母集団そのものを数えるため、これは近似ではなく一致（merge 時刻ではなく flush の有無で判定する点だけ異なる）。",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
          "expr": "count(group by (pr_url) (last_over_time(agent_pr_total_tokens{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__range])))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "title": "total tokens (merged-PR 寄与分)",
      "description": "merged-PR に寄与した総 token（input + output + cache_write + cache_read + reasoning）。⚠ semantic drift: `agent_pr_*` gauge は `pr_metrics`（is_merged=1 限定）由来なので、これは「全 session の総量」ではなく merged-PR に紐づいた分だけ。非 PR・未マージ・放棄 session の消費は含まない。`sum(last_over_time([$__range]))` で range 内の各 PR の最終値を合算する。単位: K=千、Mil=100万、Bil=10億。",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
          "expr": "sum(last_over_time(agent_pr_total_tokens{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "purple", "value": null }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "PR / 1M tokens (merged-PR 寄与分)",
      "description": "100万 token あたりに完了した merged PR 数（効率の逆数指標）。`count(group by (pr_url)(...)) * 1e6 / sum(...)` で range 全体を一括集計する。⚠ semantic drift: 分子・分母とも `pr_metrics`（is_merged=1 限定）由来の gauge なので、非 PR・未マージ・放棄 session を取りこぼす。「全活動の効率」ではなく「merged-PR に寄与した token あたりの PR 産出効率」。",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
          "expr": "count(group by (pr_url) (last_over_time(agent_pr_total_tokens{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__range]))) * 1e6 / sum(last_over_time(agent_pr_total_tokens{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "blue", "value": null }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "週別 merged PR 数",
      "description": "週ごとの merged PR スループット推移。`count by (coding_agent)(group by (pr_url, coding_agent)(last_over_time([$__interval])))` を 1w step の range クエリで評価し、各週バケット内に flush された distinct PR を数える。⚠ 近似の性質: (1) SQLite 版の weekday-0（JST 月曜）起点カレンダー週とは境界がずれる rolling/step バケット。(2) PR が複数週にまたがって flush されると複数バケットに計上されうる（SQLite 版は merge 時刻で一意の週に属す）。is_merged=1 限定なのは仕様どおり（merged PR のみが母集団）。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
          "expr": "count by (coding_agent) (group by (pr_url, coding_agent) (last_over_time(agent_pr_total_tokens{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__interval])))",
          "interval": "1w",
          "legendFormat": "{{coding_agent}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "fixedColor": "#eab308", "mode": "fixed" },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "always"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "title": "改善のきっかけ — PR 単位の外れ値検出",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "PR 別 token スコアカード",
      "description": "PR ごとの token 消費・効率・品質指標一覧。複雑度の異なる PR を比較するのではなく、外れ値を発見しドリルダウンする用途。pr_title は gauge ラベルに含まれないため列にしない（[docs/spec.md] gauge tag は VIEW projection に限定）",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 16, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
          "expr": "last_over_time(agent_pr_total_tokens{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__range])",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
          "expr": "last_over_time(agent_pr_fresh_tokens{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__range])",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
          "expr": "last_over_time(agent_pr_tokens_per_tool_use{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__range])",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
          "expr": "last_over_time(agent_pr_session_count{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__range])",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "D"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
          "expr": "last_over_time(agent_pr_mid_session_msgs_total{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__range])",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "E"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": { "byField": "pr_url", "mode": "outer" }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Time 1": true,
              "Time 2": true,
              "Time 3": true,
              "Time 4": true,
              "Time 5": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "__name__ 1": true,
              "__name__ 2": true,
              "__name__ 3": true,
              "__name__ 4": true,
              "__name__ 5": true,
              "job": true,
              "job 1": true,
              "job 2": true,
              "job 3": true,
              "job 4": true,
              "job 5": true,
              "instance": true,
              "instance 1": true,
              "instance 2": true,
              "instance 3": true,
              "instance 4": true,
              "instance 5": true,
              "task_type 2": true,
              "task_type 3": true,
              "task_type 4": true,
              "task_type 5": true,
              "coding_agent 2": true,
              "coding_agent 3": true,
              "coding_agent 4": true,
              "coding_agent 5": true,
              "user_id 2": true,
              "user_id 3": true,
              "user_id 4": true,
              "user_id 5": true,
              "model 2": true,
              "model 3": true,
              "model 4": true,
              "model 5": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "pr_url": 0,
              "user_id": 1,
              "user_id 1": 1,
              "coding_agent": 2,
              "coding_agent 1": 2,
              "model": 3,
              "model 1": 3,
              "Value #A": 4,
              "Value #B": 5,
              "Value #C": 6,
              "Value #D": 7,
              "Value #E": 8
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "total_tokens",
              "Value #B": "fresh_tokens",
              "Value #C": "tokens_per_tool_use",
              "Value #D": "session_count",
              "Value #E": "mid_session_msgs",
              "user_id 1": "user_id",
              "coding_agent 1": "coding_agent",
              "model 1": "model"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "pr_url" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "pr" },
              { "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "Open PR", "url": "${__data.fields.pr_url}" }] },
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 320 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "/^(total_tokens|fresh_tokens)$/" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "short" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 1 },
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 120 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "tokens_per_tool_use" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "short" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "lg",
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "fresh_tokens", "desc": true }]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "PR 別 session_count 分布",
      "description": "多セッション PR の外れ値検出。脱線・やり直しの兆候。上位 5 件のみ",
      "type": "barchart",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "oss-mimir" },
          "expr": "topk(5, last_over_time(agent_pr_session_count{coding_agent=~\"$coding_agent\"}[$__range]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true,
              "instance": true,
              "coding_agent": true,
              "user_id": true,
              "model": true,
              "task_type": true
            },
            "renameByName": { "Value": "session_count" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "fixedColor": "#64748b", "mode": "fixed" },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "xField": "pr_url",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
